            Replacement loses local edits and destination-only files: delete first,
            then copy.
            Deletion is permanent. No confirmation, trash, backup, or rollback;
            failures may leave partial output.
            Other agents may also load skills from these folders. sei shows
            configured folder contents, not everything an agent discovers or has
            loaded.





