=== details (80x24) ===
 sei  setup  Details
1 Edit  →  2 Review  →  3 Save
PATHS AND FIELD
Config: /home/demo/.config/sei/config.json
Project: /work/project
Current field: ~/skill-library
Source stays unchanged. Type appends; Backspace erases.

EDITING
Tab/Up/Down selects fields; typing appends; Backspace erases; Ctrl+U clears.
Ctrl+N adds an agent, Ctrl+X removes it, Ctrl+K/J changes its slot.
Enter reviews resolved paths before saving. Recognized paste is ignored.

Other agents may also load skills from these folders. sei shows configured
folder contents, not everything an agent discovers or has loaded.






